('Primitives_Polythedra','A face closes into a body','Carry data','The same first three Trace positions and FaceBody.','Add a fourth position behind the plane; list four triangular faces.','A tetrahedron and an indexed face list.','The first enclosure is explicit: three carried positions plus one computed position. The trace archive stays intact.'),
('Point_Animatedcube','Change the connection','New construction','FaceBody and indexed triangles.','Give CubeBody eight corners; choose another diagonal for one side.','A reusable cube class with visible face structure.','New corner data replaces the tetrahedron. The rendering method continues; the same shape does not.'),
('Primitives_Ignorance','A rule produces positions','New construction','FaceBody and a list of faces.','Generate opposite positions along three axes at two radii.','A small generator returning position data.','Both octahedra come from one rule. This is a new form, using the same face-building method.'),
