('Primitives_Profiles','A letter becomes a passage','New construction','The idea of carrying a profile through successive sections.','Read the O outline and its hole; sweep it through five frames.','Profiles with holes and a sequence of transforms.','A supplied font-outline helper replaces the preceding ring generator. The image is the tutorial’s O; it is not the whole museum gallery.'),
